## To native args () -> Seq of Text
## To native parseInt (s: Text) -> Int

## To gcd (a: Word64, b: Word64) -> Word64:
    Let x be a.
    Let y be b.
    While y is greater than word64(0):
        Let temp be y.
        Set y to x % y.
        Set x to temp.
    Return x.

## Main
Let arguments be args().
Let n be word64(parseInt(item 2 of arguments)).
Let sum be word64(0).
Let i be word64(1).
While i is at most n:
    Let j be i.
    While j is at most n:
        Set sum to sum + gcd(i, j).
        Set j to j + word64(1).
    Set i to i + word64(1).
Show sum.
